```

---

## 2. MAIN AGENT INTERFACE (`cmd/entire/cli/agent/agent.go`)

All agents must implement the base `Agent` interface with these method groups:

### Identity Methods (5)
- `Name() AgentName` - registry key ("kiro")
- `Type() AgentType` - display type ("Kiro")
- `Description() string` - user-facing description
- `IsPreview() bool` - stability indicator
- `DetectPresence(ctx context.Context) (bool, error)` - check if configured

### Transcript Storage Methods (3)
- `ReadTranscript(sessionRef string) ([]byte, error)` - read raw transcript
- `ChunkTranscript(ctx context.Context, content []byte, maxSize int) ([][]byte, error)` - split for storage
