## 6. NORMALIZED EVENT TYPES

**Location:** `cmd/entire/cli/agent/event.go`

Every agent translates its native hooks to these normalized event types:

```go
type EventType int

const (
    SessionStart  EventType = iota + 1  // Session began
    TurnStart                           // User submitted prompt
    TurnEnd                             // Agent finished responding
    Compaction                          // Agent compressing context
    SessionEnd                          // Session terminated
    SubagentStart                       // Task spawned
    SubagentEnd                         // Task completed
)

type Event struct {
    Type                 EventType
    SessionID            string
    PreviousSessionID    string           // For session handoffs
    SessionRef           string           // Path to transcript
    Prompt               string           // User prompt (TurnStart only)
    Timestamp            time.Time
    ToolUseID            string           // For SubagentStart/End
    SubagentID           string           // Subagent instance ID
    ToolInput            json.RawMessage  // Raw tool input JSON
    SubagentType         string           // Kind of subagent
    TaskDescription      string           // Task description
    ResponseMessage      string           // Optional user-facing message
    Metadata             map[string]string // Agent-specific state
}
```

